{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../errors/internal-server-error/", "title": "500 - InternalServerError"}, "next": {"link": "../../topics/use-filters/", "title": "Using Filters"}, "title": "Update Filters", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"update-filters\">\n<h1>Update Filters<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#update-filters\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Filters are objects that can be used to filter the content of incoming updates.\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../topics/use-filters/\"><span class=\"doc\">Read more about how filters work</span></a>.</p>\n<section id=\"module-pyrogram.filters\">\n<span id=\"details\"></span><h2>Details<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-pyrogram.filters\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.create\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">func</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">Callable</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.create\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Easily create a custom filter.</p>\n<p>Custom filters give you extra control over which updates are allowed or not to be processed by your handlers.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>func</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Callable</span></code>) \u2013 A function that accepts three positional arguments <em>(filter, client, update)</em> and returns a boolean: True if the\nupdate should be handled, False otherwise.\nThe <em>filter</em> argument refers to the filter itself and can be used to access keyword arguments (read below).\nThe <em>client</em> argument refers to the <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../client/#pyrogram.Client\" title=\"pyrogram.Client\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client</span></code></a> that received the update.\nThe <em>update</em> argument type will vary depending on which <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"handlers\">Handler</a> is coming from.\nFor example, in a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../handlers/#pyrogram.handlers.MessageHandler\" title=\"pyrogram.handlers.MessageHandler\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageHandler</span></code></a> the <em>update</em> argument will be a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>; in a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../handlers/#pyrogram.handlers.CallbackQueryHandler\" title=\"pyrogram.handlers.CallbackQueryHandler\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CallbackQueryHandler</span></code></a> the <em>update</em> will be a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/CallbackQuery/#pyrogram.types.CallbackQuery\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CallbackQuery\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CallbackQuery</span></code></a>; in a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../handlers/#pyrogram.handlers.RawUpdateHandler\" title=\"pyrogram.handlers.RawUpdateHandler\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">RawUpdateHandler</span></code></a> the <em>update</em> will be a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../telegram/base/update/#pyrogram.raw.base.Update\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Update\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Update</span></code></a>.\nYour function body can then access the incoming update attributes and decide whether to allow it or not.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Your filter\u2019s name. Can be anything you like.\nDefaults to \u201cCustomFilter\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>**kwargs</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">any</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Any keyword argument you would like to pass. Useful when creating parameterized custom filters, such as\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.command\" title=\"pyrogram.filters.command\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">command()</span></code></a> or <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.regex\" title=\"pyrogram.filters.regex\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">regex()</span></code></a>.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.all\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">all</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.all_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.all\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter all messages.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.me\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">me</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.me_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.me\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages generated by you yourself.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.bot\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">bot</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.bot_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.bot\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages coming from bots.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.incoming\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">incoming</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.incoming_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.incoming\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter incoming messages. Messages sent to your own chat (Saved Messages) are also recognised as incoming.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.outgoing\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">outgoing</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.outgoing_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.outgoing\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter outgoing messages. Messages sent to your own chat (Saved Messages) are not recognized as outgoing.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.text\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">text</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.text_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.text\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter text messages.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.reply\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reply</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.reply_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.reply\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that are replies to other messages.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.forwarded\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">forwarded</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.forwarded_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.forwarded\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that are forwarded.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.caption\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">caption</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.caption_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.caption\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter media messages that contain captions.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.audio\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">audio</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.audio_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.audio\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Audio/#pyrogram.types.Audio\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Audio\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Audio</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.document\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">document</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.document_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.document\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Document/#pyrogram.types.Document\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Document\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Document</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.photo\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">photo</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.photo_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.photo\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Photo/#pyrogram.types.Photo\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Photo\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Photo</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.sticker\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">sticker</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.sticker_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.sticker\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Sticker/#pyrogram.types.Sticker\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Sticker\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Sticker</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.animation\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">animation</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.animation_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.animation\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Animation/#pyrogram.types.Animation\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Animation\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Animation</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.game\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">game</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.game_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.game\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Game/#pyrogram.types.Game\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Game\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Game</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.giveaway\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">giveaway</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.giveaway_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.giveaway\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Giveaway/#pyrogram.types.Giveaway\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Giveaway\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Giveaway</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.giveaway_result\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">giveaway_result</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.giveaway_result_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.giveaway_result\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/GiveawayWinners/#pyrogram.types.GiveawayWinners\" title=\"pyrogram.types.GiveawayWinners\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GiveawayWinners</span></code></a> or <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/GiveawayCompleted/#pyrogram.types.GiveawayCompleted\" title=\"pyrogram.types.GiveawayCompleted\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GiveawayCompleted</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.gift_code\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">gift_code</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.gift_code_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.gift_code\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/GiftCode/#pyrogram.types.GiftCode\" title=\"pyrogram.types.GiftCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GiftCode</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.video\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">video</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.video_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.video\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages that contain <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Video/#pyrogram.types.Video\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Video\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Video</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.media_group\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.filters.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">media_group</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Filter</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;pyrogram.filters.media_group_filter</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.filters.media_group\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Filter messages containing photos or videos being part of an album.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.filters.voice\"